# Review ownership.
#
# This file exists for a narrow reason, not as ceremony. Two rules this repo
# treats as important cannot be mechanised, and a required reviewer is the only
# lever left for them:
#
#   1. "Do not hand-edit generated files." `.claude/hooks/protect-generated-files.sh`
#      stops an AGENT, and `bun run check:schemas` fails CI on drift for the
#      reference package — but nothing stops a human editing a generated file in
#      a way that happens to be self-consistent.
#
#   2. "Never re-bless the srd output snapshot without reading the diff."
#      `apps/srd/CLAUDE.md` says the diff IS the deliverable — "the complete,
#      reviewable statement of what your change did to the site" — and that
#      re-blessing without reading it defeats the entire mechanism. There is no
#      way to assert that someone read something. A named reviewer on the file
#      is the closest available thing.
#
# Everything else is deliberately unowned: a blanket owner on a solo-maintained
# repo adds a required approval to every PR and teaches people to click through
# it, which would make the two entries above worth less, not more.

# The output gate's baseline. See rule 2 above.
/apps/srd/ssg/output-snapshot.json                 @alxjrvs

# Generated artifacts, all of them diffed by `bun run check:schemas`.
/packages/salvageunion-reference/schemas/          @alxjrvs
/packages/salvageunion-reference/docs/             @alxjrvs
/packages/salvageunion-reference/lib/generated/    @alxjrvs
/packages/salvageunion-reference/etc/              @alxjrvs
/apps/itun/convex/_generated/                      @alxjrvs

# The ratchets. Each is a committed baseline that a check compares against, so
# editing one is how you make a failing check pass without fixing anything.
/coverage-baseline.json                            @alxjrvs
/tools/a11y-baseline.json                          @alxjrvs
/tools/design-tokens-baseline.json                 @alxjrvs
/tools/styling-ownership-baseline.json             @alxjrvs

# Credentials, deploy machinery and the agent-facing instruction surface.
/.github/workflows/deploy-cloudflare.yml           @alxjrvs
/.github/CODEOWNERS                                @alxjrvs
/CLAUDE.md                                         @alxjrvs
/.claude/                                          @alxjrvs
/.mcp.json                                         @alxjrvs
